- The accepted user prompt `prompts/hive-extract/HiveForYou-Extract-v1.md` is ID `hive-extract/1`, output `hive.doc-extraction/1` (one document or page range). Do NOT replace with legacy source-fact-discovery/Pack contracts or alter prompt silently.
- `prompts/hive-prep/HiveForYou-Prep-v1.md` ID `hive-prep/1` is a standalone IEP single-pass Markdown test, not a Canonical Study pipeline stage.
